  "details": "When using a PS4 controller VRChat appears to be using the controller triggers as the horizontal and vertical movement  for the camera. This causes the camera to move uncontrollably as having the triggers unpressed is forcing the camera up and to the left.\nHold both triggers at 50% you can stop the camera from constantly spinning out of control. Left trigger does horizontal while right trigger does vertical movement.\nPlease fix your bindings for the ps4 controller as this has been broken for quite some time, or handle the fact that the triggers are for some reason being used instead of the joystick.",
